config GOOGLE_TTF_TEST
	tristate "Google TTF test suite"
	depends on KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Enables KUnit unit testing for the TTF module in GBMS.
	  TTF calculates remaining charging duration using adapter power limits, battery
	  health status, SOC thresholds, and CCCM temperature tables. The test suite
	  validates SOC time estimation, battery current reductions, adapter power constraints,
	  and invalid input error handling. Say Y or M to build the test suite as `google_ttf_test`.

config GOOGLE_BATTERY_TTF_TESTS
	tristate "Google Battery TTF tests"
	depends on KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Enables KUnit unit testing for gbatt_get_ttf in Google Battery driver.
	  gbatt_get_ttf coordinates remaining charging time reporting between the TTF
	  estimation algorithm and fuel gauge calculations. The test suite validates google_battery
	  integration with TTF algorithm. Say Y or M to build the test suite as
	  `google_battery_ttf_tests`.
